SUMMARY
Hunt-focused Moderate scenario. Builds hunting cadence and query discipline — hunters must iterate through hypotheses methodically, a habit that distinguishes systematic hunters from those who 'get lucky'.

LEARNING OBJECTIVES
- How to identify elements of exfiltration
- How to interpret Process Events to identify evidence of malicious activity
- How to navigate command line arguments

SOURCE
https://kc7cyber.com/challenges/381

